	<!-- ZO Mirror Golem (Retribution) [LONEWOLF]
		 A high health golem that reflects 60% of all damage taken no matter what the source. Due to its unusual composition it is impossible to repair by standard
		 means and instead utilizes an advanced self-repair function that regrows damaged portions using available resources. This means it takes a bit longer to recover
		 from combat damage than most things but also can recover from a crippling disability on its own given enough time uninterrupted. -->
	<entity name="RetributionGolem"
			thematic_groups="GolemCapturable,Zenith"
			special_entity_type="MobileOfficerCombatFleetFlagship"
			tags="ShowsOnNormalDisplayMode,Capturable,AnyOfficer,NonArkOfficer" capturable_seed_weight="100" capturable_max_per_galaxy="1"
